ery never acknowledges a record it couldn’t hand to every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination, so a store that still keeps one delivers it on a later launch, with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/isRedelivered"},{"type":"text","text":" set."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A store of your own should implement it. Without it, the default returns no records, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"batch a full buffer dropped isn’t sent again in this run: the destination whose buffer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dropped it never gets it in this run, every destination gets it again on the next launch,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"marked redelivered, and the store holds it until then, toward its bound."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The delivery gives each record returned the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/isRedelivered","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sensitive-value visibility and the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"text":" the record had when the buffer dropped","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it, so a store needn’t keep them. A record tagged with another store is ignored.","type":"text"}]}]}],"references":{"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Acknowledger":{"url":"\/documentation\/events\/acknowledger","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Acknowledger","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Acknowledger","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"What keeps records until their delivery is acknowledged: a store, as a delivery sees it.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Acknowledger","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol",